meta {
  name: Get Vehicle Full Detail By ID
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/vehicle/detail/full/:id
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  id: 4f33d5e4-de9f-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Vehicle Full Detail By ID

  This request is used to get vehicle detail by `id`, it comes with Wash and Trip History. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name | Type   | Required | Description | Example                               |
  |------|--------|----------|--------------|------------------------------------------|
  | id   | string | yes      | Vehicle ID  | 4f33d5e4-de9f-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002   |

  ## Responses

  **200 — vehicle fetched successfully**
```json
